          "type": "heading",
          "text": "HTC LIFE.ME"
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Life.me is a personal timeline application that traces users' phone activity by capturing events happening around them. It's like a personal secretary that helps users bring up their memories in an effortless, smart and fun way."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "My responsibilities to this project was interaction design. I also worked as a design lead in a cross-functional team with visual and motion designers, user researchers, prototypers, project managers and developers."
        }
